01:14:25.940 --> 01:14:28.680
I guess I could figure out how to make it work or something like that.

01:14:28.860 --> 01:14:30.420
Yeah, I mean, this is a crossfade.

01:14:30.500 --> 01:14:33.960
You just fade. Yeah, or, you know, we can organically fade.

01:14:34.360 --> 01:14:40.160
What if we all just start talking at the same time and we just make it, like, let's just start fading out ourselves with our volume.

